{"version":1,"content":"<p>《華爾街日報》今（31日）報道，分析船舶追蹤資料發現，中國大陸船隻在台灣南部及東部大片海域來回航行，用數十艘研究船採取「類似割草機反覆往返的航路」收集海洋資料。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:10.850294+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":80,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T13:29:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:24.874129+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.062851+00:00","content_hash":"f8930b02a054e44ce1f45a1c577d4660678d5f37b845b27f6765ada147b48e96","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}